  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-swimlane": "`__operator_swimlane__:<title>` - ወረቀት ካርዳት ኣብ ምስ *<title>* ዝሰማምዑ መገድታት",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-comment": "`__operator_comment__:<text>` - ጽሑፍ *<text>* ዝሓዘ ርእይቶ ዘለወን ወረቀት ካርዳት።",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-label": "`__operator_label__:<color>` `__operator_label__:<name>` - ምስ *<color>* ወይ *<name>* ዝሰማማዕ እሻረት ዘለወን ወረቀት ካርዳት",
